><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q3: yes there was previous research on this topic. This article justified as previous research was flawed an inconclusive. Justified as more evidence is needed.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="2" rect="609.448975,205.968658,793.448975,297.968658"
