><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="6" rect="609.448975,249.296997,793.448975,341.296997"
/></highlight
><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250709120444+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250709120455+10'00'" name="a67a506b-b9ff-4a33-9797-7e14fcaf3d15" page="6" coords="48.018799,118.120972,298.709320,118.120972,48.018799,106.702011,298.709320,106.702011,48.018799,106.102524,298.726593,106.102524,48.018799,94.683563,298.726593,94.683563,48.018799,94.140121,298.714264,94.140121,48.018799,82.721161,298.714264,82.721161,48.018799,82.121658,298.708435,82.121658,48.018799,70.702698,298.708435,70.702698,48.018799,70.102264,298.701843,70.102264,48.018799,58.683304,298.701843,58.683304,48.018799,58.140808,298.732239,58.140808,48.018799,46.721848,298.732239,46.721848" rect="47.661957,46.365005,299.089081,118.477814" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-16.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>&#xD;</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>During maximal sprint cycling, the decrement in power output is dependent on the number of cumulative pedal strokes. The decrement is individualised; however, irrelevant of the cadence, the relative decrement in power output each stroke elicited was equal. As a result of this finding, a novel approach to optimising sprint performance could be to select a cadence </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-16.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>&#xD;</span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-12.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>that both maximises the ability to produce power and minimises the effect of fatigue. Further research could investigate the physiological mechanisms underpinning the cumulative pedal stroke-determined fatigue rate.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="6" rect="609.448975,26.120972,793.448975,118.120972"
/></highlight
